4                                 c: Interportation order for the spectral-element method //N
0.01                              c: Time interval //dt
1.0                               c: The domaint frequency of the Ricker wavelet // F
100                               c: Time at Every N*dt is shown on the screen  // nstep
100                               c: Snapshot at every N*dt   // nsnap
0                                 c: 1=wavefile in computation domain; 0=wavefile in computation domain+PML domain
8000.0                            c: The Vp for PML ABC
5                                 c: The number of element for the PML (in X direction)  // Layx
5                                 c: The number of element for the PML (in Z direction)  // Layz
1.0e-6                            c: The damping factor // R0
2                                 c: The flag of PML    // Pflag
2000                              c: The average scale of the element size (m)  // dis
20                                c: Devide each element into small elements to find the positions of source and receiver (<100) // ndiv
Moment-tensor                     c: The name of the file Containing Moment tensor
1                                 c: 1=Point vertical source; 2=Explosive source
120000.0   40000.0                c: The horizontal and vertical scales of the computational domain
